<title>UK: Hanil Bank sets 300 mln mark 3-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Hanil Bank sets 300 mln mark 3-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Bayerische Landesbank</p>
<p> BORROWER   HANIL BANK</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN DEM   COUPON     4.375     MATURITY    17.APR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.235   PAY DATE    17.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.80	REOFFER    99.66     SPREAD	+51 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	A3	  LISTING    MUN/FFT   PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE/KR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.225     SELL CONC  1.275     LIST FEE    0.30</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 113 OBL DUE JANUARY 2000</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
